        <section class="examples-section" id="examples">
          <div class="examples-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow">The language workspace</div>
            <h2>See the difference.<br />Explore the details.</h2>
            <p>
              Explore translation, language review, subtitles, and voice preparation through
              interactive examples.
            </p>
            <div class="example-note">
              <span>↗</span>
              <p>Illustrative examples · select a service to explore</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="workbench">
            <div class="bench-bar">
              <div><span class="bench-dot"></span> The language workspace</div>
              <span class="bench-languages">EN → VI</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bench-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Explore our services">
              <button
                id="tab-localization"
                role="tab"
                aria-selected="true"
                aria-controls="panel-localization"
                data-demo="localization"
              >
                Localization</button
              ><button
                id="tab-lqa"
                role="tab"
                aria-selected="false"
                aria-controls="panel-lqa"
                tabindex="-1"
                data-demo="lqa"
              >
                LQA</button
              ><button
                id="tab-subtitles"
                role="tab"
                aria-selected="false"
                aria-controls="panel-subtitles"
                tabindex="-1"
                data-demo="subtitles"
              >
                Subtitling</button
              ><button
                id="tab-dubbing"
                role="tab"
                aria-selected="false"
                aria-controls="panel-dubbing"
                tabindex="-1"
                data-demo="dubbing"
              >
                Dubbing
              </button>
            </div>
            <section
              class="bench-panel"
              id="panel-localization"
              role="tabpanel"
              aria-labelledby="tab-localization"
              tabindex="0"
            >
              <div class="demo-caption">
                <span>01 / WORDS IN CONTEXT</span><span class="demo-pill">Website &amp; app</span>
              </div>
              <div class="app-example">
                <div class="app-side">
                  <span class="app-emblem" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><i></i><i></i><i></i>
                </div>
                <div class="app-screen">
                  <div class="app-nav"><b>STUDIO / 01</b><span aria-hidden="true">○ ○ ○</span></div>
                  <div class="app-graphic" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="shape-one"></div>
                    <div class="shape-two"></div>
                    <span>ă</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="app-text">
                    <small>ENGLISH</small><span lang="en">Make room for new ideas.</span>
                    <div class="app-translated">
                      <small>VIETNAMESE</small><strong lang="vi">Đón những ý tưởng mới.</strong
                      ><span lang="vi" class="fake-button">Bắt đầu khám phá ↗</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="bench-outcome">
                <span class="check-round" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                <p>Meaning preserved. A voice that feels natural.</p>
              </div>
              <a class="bench-link" href="/en/vietnamese-translation/"
                >Explore localization <span>↗</span></a
              >
            </section>
            <section
              class="bench-panel"
              id="panel-lqa"
              role="tabpanel"
              aria-labelledby="tab-lqa"
              tabindex="0"
              hidden
            >
              <div class="demo-caption">
                <span>02 / EVERY DETAIL COUNTS</span><span class="demo-pill">Language review</span>
              </div>
              <div class="issue-example">
                <div class="issue-head">
                  <span class="issue-id">STRING / 024</span
                  ><span class="issue-category">Terminology</span>
                </div>
                <small>SOURCE TEXT</small>
                <p lang="en">Save your progress.</p>
                <div class="issue-before">
                  <span>Before review</span><del lang="vi">Tiết kiệm tiến trình của bạn.</del>
                </div>
                <div class="issue-after">
                  <span>After review</span><strong lang="vi">Lưu tiến trình của bạn.</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="issue-comment">
                  <span aria-hidden="true">↳</span>
                  <p>In this context, “save” means storing progress, not saving money.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="bench-outcome">
                <span class="check-round" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                <p>Clear findings. Practical corrections.</p>
              </div>
              <a class="bench-link" href="/en/vietnamese-lqa/">Explore LQA <span>↗</span></a>
            </section>
            <section
              class="bench-panel"
              id="panel-subtitles"
              role="tabpanel"
              aria-labelledby="tab-subtitles"
              tabindex="0"
              hidden
            >
              <div class="demo-caption">
                <span>03 / LET THE STORY FLOW</span
                ><span class="demo-pill">Film &amp; short drama</span>
              </div>
              <div class="subtitle-example">
                <div class="scene-art" aria-hidden="true">
                  <div class="scene-sun"></div>
                  <div class="scene-hill hill-one"></div>
                  <div class="scene-hill hill-two"></div>
                  <div class="scene-window"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="scene-label">SCENE / 01</span>
                <p class="scene-subtitle" id="scene-subtitle" lang="vi" aria-live="polite">
                  Mọi hành trình đều bắt đầu từ đây.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="cue-controls">
                <label for="cue-range">Preview subtitle cues</label
                ><output id="cue-time" for="cue-range">00:01 / 00:09</output
                ><input
                  id="cue-range"
                  type="range"
                  min="1"
                  max="3"
                  step="1"
                  value="1"
                  aria-controls="scene-subtitle"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="bench-outcome">
                <span class="check-round" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                <p>Natural dialogue. Readable timing.</p>
              </div>
              <a class="bench-link" href="/en/vietnamese-subtitling/"
                >Explore film translation <span>↗</span></a
              >
            </section>
            <section
              class="bench-panel"
              id="panel-dubbing"
              role="tabpanel"
              aria-labelledby="tab-dubbing"
              tabindex="0"
              hidden
            >
              <div class="demo-caption">
                <span>04 / GIVE YOUR STORY A VOICE</span
                ><span class="demo-pill">Dubbing &amp; voice-over</span>
              </div>
              <div class="voice-example">
                <div class="voice-script">
                  <small>VIETNAMESE SCRIPT</small>
                  <p lang="vi">Câu chuyện của chúng ta<br />bắt đầu từ hôm nay.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="track-row track-a">
                  <span>Voice A</span>
                  <div class="track-wave" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                  <span>00:04</span>
                </div>
                <div class="track-row track-b">
                  <span>Voice B</span>
                  <div class="track-wave" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                  <span>00:06</span>
                </div>
                <div class="track-ruler">
                  <span>00:00</span><span>00:05</span><span>00:10</span>
                </div>
                <p class="voice-note">Visual example · no audio playback</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bench-outcome">
                <span class="check-round" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                <p>Script, performance, and audio review.</p>
              </div>
              <a class="bench-link" href="/en/vietnamese-dubbing/"
                >Explore voice services <span>↗</span></a
              >
            </section>
            <div class="bench-foot">
              <span class="dot"></span
              ><span>Illustrative examples · select a service to explore</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <section class="section" id="industries">
          <div class="sectionhead">
            <div>
              <div class="eyebrow">Made for your medium</div>
              <h2>Built for the content you create.</h2>
            </div>
            <p>Language shaped around how your audience experiences your product.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="industries">
            <article class="industry">
              <span class="bigicon">✣</span><small>PLAY</small>
              <h3>Games &amp; interactive</h3>
              <p>Dialogue, UI strings, player communications, and in-context language review.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="industry">
              <span class="bigicon">▷</span><small>WATCH &amp; LISTEN</small>
              <h3>Film &amp; short drama</h3>
              <p>Subtitles, adapted dialogue, Vietnamese dubbing, and audio quality review.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="industry">
              <span class="bigicon">⌘</span><small>DISCOVER</small>
              <h3>Digital &amp; brands</h3>
              <p>Websites, apps, product content, and messages adapted for the local market.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
      <section class="quality section" id="quality">
        <div class="wrap qualitygrid">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Quality is in the details</div>
            <h2>Correct is a start.<br />Natural is the goal.</h2>
            <p>
              A translation can be accurate and still feel out of place. We look beyond individual
              words to the intent, the experience, and the person on the other side.
            </p>
            <ul class="ticks">
              <li>Native Vietnamese language review</li>
              <li>Terminology and style guide alignment</li>
              <li>Context checks and actionable issue reports</li>
              <li>Revision review before final delivery</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="btn light" href="/en/vietnamese-lqa/"
              >Inside our QA approach <span>↗</span></a
            >
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="qa-demo">
              <div class="qa-top">
                <span>VNLOCALIZATION / LANGUAGE REVIEW</span><span>EN → VI</span>
              </div>
              <div class="qa-body">
                <div class="q-label">SOURCE TEXT</div>
                <p class="source">“Jump back into the action.”</p>
                <div class="toggle" role="group" aria-label="Compare translation">
                  <button data-version="literal">Literal translation</button
                  ><button class="active" data-version="reviewed">After native review ✓</button>
                </div>
                <div class="translation">
                  <div class="q-label" id="review-label">NATURAL • CONTEXT-AWARE</div>
                  <strong id="translation" lang="vi" aria-live="polite">Trở lại cuộc chiến!</strong
                  ><span class="dialogcopy" id="review-note"
                    >An energetic, natural invitation for an action game.</span
                  >
                </div>
                <div class="status">
                  <span>TONE &amp; CULTURAL FIT</span
                  ><span class="badge" id="review-badge">✓ Reviewed</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="qa-caption">
              Illustrative localization example. Final wording depends on context.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <section class="section process" id="process">
          <div class="sectionhead">
            <div>
              <div class="eyebrow">A clear path from brief to delivery</div>
              <h2>From your brief<br />to your final delivery.</h2>
            </div>
            <p>A practical workflow, a shared brief, and clear communication at every stage.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="steps">
            <div class="step">
              <strong>01 / DISCOVER</strong>
              <h3>Tell us the story</h3>
              <p>
                Share your content, audience, languages, and timeline. We align on scope and
                deliverables.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
              <strong>02 / ALIGN</strong>
              <h3>Set the direction</h3>
              <p>Agree on terminology, tone, technical requirements, and a sample where needed.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
              <strong>03 / CREATE &amp; REVIEW</strong>
              <h3>Bring it to life</h3>
              <p>
                Translate, adapt, or record, then check the work against the agreed quality
                criteria.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
              <strong>04 / DELIVER</strong>
              <h3>Ready for your audience</h3>
              <p>
                Receive your agreed files, review feedback, and resolve revisions within the defined
                scope.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="aboutband">
          <div class="eyebrow">Native expertise, practical delivery</div>
          <h2>Vietnamese expertise.<br />Grounded in real work.</h2>
          <p>
            Our team brings experience in Vietnamese language QA, text and audio review,
            English-to-Vietnamese short-drama subtitling, and Vietnamese voice recording. Every new
            engagement starts with a clear scope and the right qualification process.
          </p>
          <a class="textlink" href="/en/about/">Meet your language partner ↗</a>
        </section>
        <section class="faq">
          <h2>A few things you might ask.</h2>
          <details>
            <summary>Which languages do you focus on?</summary>
            <p>
              Our focus is Vietnamese, including English-to-Vietnamese localization and Vietnamese
              linguistic review. Other language pairs can be discussed and confirmed based on the
              project and qualified linguist availability.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can we start with a sample or a pilot?</summary>
            <p>
              Yes. Share a representative sample and your acceptance criteria so we can agree on a
              suitable pilot scope, timeline, and any applicable fees before starting.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What do you need to prepare a quote?</summary>
            <p>
              Please include your service, source and target languages, word count or video
              duration, file formats, deadline, and review requirements. For dubbing, voice count,
              synchronization needs, and audio delivery specifications also help define the scope.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can you work with our existing translations?</summary>
            <p>
              Yes. We can scope proofreading, machine translation post-editing, or LQA around your
              existing content. Please provide the source, translation, relevant context, and any
              terminology or style guides.
            </p>
          </details>
        </section>
        <section class="cta">
          <div>
            <h2>Ready to connect with<br />Vietnamese audiences?</h2>
            <p>A new launch, a short drama, or an ongoing language project?</p>
          </div>
          <button class="btn quote">Start the conversation <span class="arrow">↗</span></button>
        </section>
      </div>
